('it','03_Cloud_Infrastructure_Data_and_Emerging_Technologies',null,'8. UAE Sector Use Cases and Localization Notes','*   **Logistics**: Dubai Sustainable City launched a pilot for autonomous delivery robots with wait times under 30 minutes. — *Tech Explorer Zone, [[37]](#ref37)
