('it','05_Cybersecurity_Governance_AppSec_Network_and_Cloud_Security',null,'11. Gaps and Verification Notes','*   **[Verify]** The specific version of the DESC Web Security Policy is often updated; practitioners should check the DESC portal for the latest "Web Security Policy" document which provides granular coding requirements.
*   **[Not Found]** A single, unified "UAE Secure Coding Standard" document from the Cybersecurity Council was not identified; instead, entities rely on a combination of DESC ISR, NESA IAS, and global standards like OWASP.
*   **[Live Data]** Compliance deadlines for CBUAE''s new authentication rules are set for March 2026; implementation status across all LFIs is currently in progress.

