('company','Quote Quality',null,'How does QuotesDone ensure quotes are good quality?','Every supplier quote is scored for quality with 70 as the pass mark, and suppliers get coaching to improve. This raises the standard of quotes reaching buyers.','company canon Quote Quality','COMPANY_CANON'),
