('legal','Official_Resources_and_Links',null,'Appendix R7: Healthcare licensing — portal audit checklist','| Step | Check | Evidence to save |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Confirm the current authority name and portal URL | Screenshot/PDF of portal header and service page |
| 2 | Confirm whether UAE PASS or corporate login is required | Login requirement note and account owner |
| 3 | Confirm latest service fee and payment channel | Fee table, invoice sample or portal payment page |
| 4 | Confirm required documents and file formats | Checklist from authority portal |
| 5 | Confirm processing time and escalation route | SLA, contact centre number or case-ticket route |
| 6 | Confirm whether Arabic text or notarised translation is required | Authority instruction or legal provision |
| 7 | Save final submission reference | Application number, receipt and certificate |','legal Official Resources and Links','Official_Resources_and_Links.md'),
