| MOHRE | https://www.mohre.gov.ae | Employers, employees, PROs, labour lawyers | Work permits, labour contracts, WPS, complaints, Emiratisation | Mainland private-sector labour compliance is generally MOHRE-led, except special regimes such as DIFC/ADGM/free-zone employment systems. |
| Ministry of Economy | https://www.economy.gov.ae | Companies, consumers, IP owners, agencies | Commercial agencies, consumer protection, IP links, competition policy | Corporate licensing is often local/free-zone, but federal commercial law and policy sit here. |
| Ministry of Finance | https://www.mof.gov.ae | Finance teams, investors, public-policy users | Federal budget, fiscal policy, tax treaty material, procurement context | Useful for macro and treaty research. |
| MOCCAE | https://www.moccae.gov.ae | Environmental consultants, importers, agriculture/fisheries users | Environmental policy, CITES, food/agriculture, climate, biodiversity | Project-level EIAs may be emirate-level unless federal/cross-border. |
| MoIAT | https://www.moiat.gov.ae | Manufacturers, product importers, labs | Standards, conformity, industrial strategy, Make it in the Emirates | ESMA functions are integrated; ECAS/EQM product conformity matters often route here. |
| TDRA | https://tdra.gov.ae | Telecom operators, ICT firms, app/platform operators | Spectrum, telecom licensing, digital-government standards | Telecom and digital services compliance should be checked here. |
| GCAA | https://www.gcaa.gov.ae | Aviation companies, drone operators, developers near air corridors | Air operator certificates, drone rules, aviation safety, airspace | Tall structures and drones may need GCAA / local aviation NOC. |
| FANR | https://www.fanr.gov.ae | Nuclear, radiation, medical/industrial radiation users | Nuclear safety, radiation source licensing, Barakah oversight | Radiation sources in hospitals/industry require licensing and safety controls. |
| CBUAE | https://www.centralbank.ae | Banks, insurers, payment providers, compliance teams | Banking supervision, insurance, exchange houses, payment services, AML | Financial-sector registers and consumer complaint routes are here. |
