('legal','Official_Resources_and_Links',null,'18.1 Legal research workflow','1. Identify whether the matter is federal, emirate-level, free-zone, common-law free-zone or sector-regulated.
2. Check the official Arabic text on elaws or the relevant emirate/free-zone portal.
3. Use English translations for working convenience only unless the portal states they are authoritative.
4. Check implementing regulations, cabinet decisions, ministerial decisions and circulars.
5. For disputes, check whether the contract has a court jurisdiction clause or arbitration clause.
6. For construction and real estate, cross-check Civil Code, emirate building law, municipality circulars, Civil Defence, land department rules and contract terms.','legal Official Resources and Links','Official_Resources_and_Links.md'),
