('legal','Official_Resources_and_Links',null,'26. Red-Flag Verification Checklist','Before relying on any entry in this directory, verify the following live items:

| Item | Why verification is needed |
|---|---|
| Fees | UAE portals frequently update service fees, knowledge fees, innovation fees and typing-centre charges. |
| URLs | Portal redesigns may move service pages or consolidate authorities. |
| Regulator names | SCA/CMA, ESMA/MoIAT and other institutional changes may affect naming and jurisdiction. |
| Service eligibility | Many services depend on nationality, residence emirate, licence type, free-zone jurisdiction or sponsor status. |
| Legal text | Arabic official text controls; English translations may be unofficial. |
| Implementation dates | 2025–2026 legal reforms may have staged commencement or implementing decisions. |
| Free-zone requirements | Office, visa quota, audit, substance and activity restrictions vary by package and year. |
| Construction NOC sequence | Sequence varies by emirate, free zone, plot type and project size. |
| Tax deadlines | Deadlines depend on financial year, registration date and tax type. |
| Employment rules | Mainland, free-zone, DIFC and ADGM employment frameworks differ. |','legal Official Resources and Links','Official_Resources_and_Links.md'),
('legal','Official_Resources_and_Links',null,'Appendix R9: Real-estate registration — portal audit checklist','| Step | Check | Evidence to save |
