('legal','UAE_Construction_Laws_and_Contracts',null,'7.2 Federal engineering-project e-qualification','MOEI''s service page for registration/e-qualification covers consultants, contractors and suppliers for engineering projects and records service fees such as AED 500 for new registration and annual renewal/fine concepts [[20]](#ref20). For federal infrastructure tenders, contractors should maintain both emirate classification and federal e-qualification where required.

