('legal','UAE_Construction_Laws_and_Contracts',null,'8.1 FIDIC White Book 2017','| Clause group | Subject | UAE drafting focus |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Definitions and interpretation | UAE law, Arabic/English, project documents, authority definitions |
| 2 | Commencement and completion | Notice to proceed, programme, deliverable schedule, suspension |
| 3 | Services | Scope matrix, design stages, supervision, authority approvals, BIM deliverables |
| 4 | Payment | Time-based, lump sum, milestone, percentage fee, reimbursables, VAT |
| 5 | Consultant obligations | Skill/care, fitness only if expressly assumed, conflicts, records, authority coordination |
| 6 | Client obligations | Information, access, decisions, payment, permits support |
| 7 | Insurance | PI, professional liability, cyber/BIM, public liability, minimum AED limits |
| 8 | Disputes | DAAB/expert determination/arbitration; DIAC or local court routes |

Fee methods in UAE consultancy appointments:

- time-based hourly/daily rates;
- lump sum by stage;
- percentage of construction cost, often 3–6% for full design plus supervision on ordinary building projects, subject to complexity;
- cost reimbursable plus fee;
- hybrid design lump sum plus supervision monthly retainer.','legal UAE Construction Laws and Contracts','UAE_Construction_Laws_and_Contracts.md'),
('legal','UAE_Construction_Laws_and_Contracts',null,'8.2 Dubai Municipality consultant grades','| Grade | Scope | Minimum staff | Minimum PI insurance |
