| E44 | Dubai-Hatta road corridor | Hatta tourism and Oman-border movement. |
| Salik | Dubai electronic tolling system | Travel-cost modelling, fleet management and logistics pricing. |','legal UAE General Information','UAE_General_Information.md'),
('legal','UAE_General_Information',null,'16.2 Rail and metro','The national freight network has become an important industrial logistics layer, especially for aggregates, sulphur, cement, containers and future passenger movement. Dubai Metro is the country''s most mature urban rail network and anchors transit-oriented development around the Red and Green Lines, Route 2020 and future Blue Line works. Abu Dhabi''s rail/metro planning remains important but should be checked against live procurement and DMT announcements.','legal UAE General Information','UAE_General_Information.md'),
