| AAN | Al Ain | Secondary Abu Dhabi emirate airport and training/cargo potential. |','legal UAE General Information','UAE_General_Information.md'),
('legal','UAE_General_Information',null,'16.4 Ports and maritime infrastructure','| Port | Emirate | Strategic function |
