| Ajman / UAQ / RAK ports | Northern Emirates | Regional cargo, fishing, industrial and SME logistics. |','legal UAE General Information','UAE_General_Information.md'),
('legal','UAE_General_Information',null,'16.5 Power and water','The UAE power-water system is shaped by summer peak cooling demand, desalination, high reliability expectations and rapid solar deployment. Utilities are emirate-specific, but federal energy policy, climate targets and grid integration increasingly matter. Desalination and district cooling are especially important because potable water and cooling are core operating costs for buildings, hotels, malls and industrial facilities.','legal UAE General Information','UAE_General_Information.md'),
('legal','UAE_General_Information',null,'17.1 School governance','| Segment | Regulator | Notes |
