('legal','UAE_General_Information',null,'22. Verification Notes','This file deliberately separates stable background facts from operationally live facts. Geography, historical periods, institutional roles and emirate profiles are relatively stable. Population, GDP, cabinet membership, school rankings, bank assets, tariffs, airport passenger numbers, rail-launch dates, visa requirements and regulatory fees are live operational data and must be checked against the relevant official portal or statistical authority before contractual, legal, investment or engineering reliance. Where exact figures in the existing file conflicted with other common estimates, the safer practice is to treat them as approximate and verify from FCSC, SCAD, DSC, CBUAE, ministry portals or regulator publications.','legal UAE General Information','UAE_General_Information.md'),
